### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Thantawan"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get me (ใส่ token จาก login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create trip
POST http://localhost:5000/api/trips/add-trip
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "ทริปทดสอบ",
  "description": "สวัสดี"
}

### Get my trips
GET http://localhost:5000/api/trips/all-my-trips
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE